This project derives file format behavior and will derive game-engine behavior
from ScummVM's GPLv3 Kyra engine:

  https://github.com/scummvm/scummvm/tree/master/engines/kyra

Initial format references:

- engines/kyra/resource/resource_intern.cpp (Westwood PAK)
- engines/kyra/graphics/screen.cpp (CPS, LCW and palette decoding)
- engines/kyra/engine/lol.cpp (Lands of Lore startup flow)
- engines/kyra/sequence/sequences_lol.cpp (prologue flow)

